{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現時於廣州星海音樂學院修讀流行音樂系 Year 3 的詹天文（Windy），隨著新學期展開已正式重返校園生活。她日前於社交平台晒出一輯開學日常靚相，在大派福利的同時，更展現出相當自律的生活狀態。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在封面照片中，可見詹天文穿上白色吊帶小背心搭配黑色短褲，前往健身室做 Gym 勤力操肌，大騷迷人鎖骨與修長美腿。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4cd02cdb-d59d-4852-abbb-ab4621bcc89a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026WqKMAF4mNA1789376309.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4cd02cdb-d59d-4852-abbb-ab4621bcc89a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cb454035-5c3e-4ebe-9543-17bacdeccf98.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026g0YWbd71UO1789376309.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cb454035-5c3e-4ebe-9543-17bacdeccf98.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0f09677a-f438-4729-89c6-43598d29a95b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026sLTfvuZpeU1789376308.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0f09677a-f438-4729-89c6-43598d29a95b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了積極運動，她亦分享了多張校園日常點滴，包括在車內大啖咬着薄餅的可愛模樣，以及前往超市探索各式美食與購物的過程，可見其生活過得相當充實。一眾粉絲看到她的最新近況後，紛紛湧入留言區支持：「新學期加油呀」、「身材好Fit」、「又靚又自律！」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T09:18:51.049492+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}